{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12210120","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12210120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1221012001:1":{"text":"음아... 여, 여긴 어디죠? 저... 아직 살아 있는 건가요...?","source_cn":"呃啊……这、这是哪？我还活着吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE903AA5E3C32122E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1221012002:1":{"text":"깼어! 깼어!","source_cn":"醒了！醒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x006314EF73608A6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1221012003:1":{"text":"마... 말을 할 줄 아는 식물이라니! 분명 꿈을 꾸고 있는 걸 거야... 설마 내가 이미...","source_cn":"会……会说话的植物！我一定在做梦……难道我已经……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10BCD33529FA3E67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221012004:1":{"text":"긴장하지 마세요! 이제 괜찮아요! 부상도 다 치료되었고요!","source_cn":"别紧张！你已经没事了，连身上的伤都好了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8495D6732B7C72AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1221012005:1":{"text":"이 빛나는 꽃들이 당신을 구한 거예요. 그러니 두려워하지 않아도 돼요!","source_cn":"是这些荧荧花救了你，所以你不用害怕它们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10A7A058B9420DAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1221012006:1":{"text":"저를 구했다고요...? 꼭 어린아이에게 들려주는 모험 이야기 같네요.","source_cn":"它们救了我……？这，这简直像是讲给小孩的冒险故事一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC8263441A57C607","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1221012007:0":{"text":"음, 고마워... 빛나는 꽃이라고 했지?","source_cn":"呃，总之要谢谢你们……是叫荧荧花来着吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2C109D9FAFF20E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1221012008:1":{"text":"괜찮아! 괜찮아!","source_cn":"不客气！不客气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63C6D0F89D8D1601","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1221012009:1":{"text":"빛나는 꽃은, 소원을, 들어준 거야!","source_cn":"荧荧花是，帮他，实现心愿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E7C6830BE15071A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1221012010:0":{"text":"...잠깐! 날 또 가리키지 말라고!","source_cn":"……等等！别又指着我啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA05178458EA7126B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1221012011:0":{"text":"물귀신?! 왜 물귀신도 여기에 있는 거지?!","source_cn":"水鬼？！怎么水鬼也在这里？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":